WEBVTT


00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.400
And another thing, the bank want to see your trust

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.520
and the bank should be the only one seeing your trust.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
Your life estate is real estate.

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:11.240
It's literally a movable property,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.740
which means you cannot own it.

00:00:13.741 --> 00:00:15.960
You can only have interest in it.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.220
Your trust should be a non grantor

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:23.160
irrevocable living trust where your birth certificate name is not trusty.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.660
Once you understand that

00:00:24.661 --> 00:00:28.200
the birth certificate name has retired from the world of commerce,

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.300
you can peacefully receive your interest and principle like you supposed to,

00:00:33.301 --> 00:00:36.520
but it's ultimately because you no longer trading with the enemy.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.240
Over here we talk about money of account, not money of exchange.
